# ファイル変換 on the x64 PC (tools/x64/ui_run64.py): tools/tests/ui_xfconv.steps with the disks
# of the q35 machine: nvmea (the NVMe disk), nvmea0 (/boot), nvmea1 and nvmea2 (/tslog) above ネットワーク(FTP),
# so the FTP entry is at 182,271 and /boot at 182,175; the rest as there.
# ファイル変換 (design 17.17), for tools/ui_run.py:
# started by opening its program object, as a double press on its link
# in the program box starts it, the disks and
# ネットワーク(FTP) listed as blue 仮身; the FTP panel opened and put away;
# nvmea0 (/boot) opened in a window of its own.
dclick 80 141
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expect xfconv: ready
wait 500
win ファイル変換
shot xfc_media
dclick 182 271
expect xfconv: asked for an FTP connection
wait 500
shot xfc_ftp
key 29
expect xfconv: ftp cancelled
dclick 182 175
expect xfconv: window nvmea0
wait 500
win nvmea0
shot xfc_files
# two files chosen (the click, then Shift+↓) and carried into the BTRON
# window: the panel asks how, Enter makes them 実身 there, linked where let go
click 242 247
key 51 2
expect xfconv: selected 2:
shot xfc_chosen
wait 600
hold 242 247
wait 300
move 150 200
wait 100
move 60 120
wait 300
up
expect xfconv: carried 2 into
expect xfconv: asked how to import 2:
wait 500
shot xfc_import_panel
key 28
expect xfconv: placed 2 links
wait 800
shot xfc_placed
wait 600
# the file list moved to the right, 仮身サンプル brought forward, and its
# link TADjsについて let go on the list: the panel, and the file written there
drag 400 140 800 140
wait 300
win nvmea0
click 60 241
wait 300
drag 400 413 900 450
expect xfconv: asked how to export 1:
wait 500
shot xfc_export_panel
key 28
expect xfconv: exported
wait 500
shot xfc_exported
# the list brought forward, Home and ↓↓ to the first file, made 実身 with Ctrl+I: a new box, opened by the desktop on white paper
click 1100 560
key 4a
key 51
key 51
key 0c 1
expect xfconv: asked how to import 1:
key 28
expect xfconv: imported 1 of 1
wait 1500
shot xfc_box
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
